# Content Manager — environment template.
# Copy to ".env" and fill in (zernio.py reads THIS file). NEVER paste keys into the chat — only here.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ZERNIO — Comment-to-DM funnels & multi-channel publishing (helper/zernio.py)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Zernio (zernio.com) creates the comment→DM keyword trigger via API and posts
# to Instagram / TikTok / LinkedIn / Threads. First 2 connected accounts are FREE.
# Setup once: sign up → connect your IG (OAuth) → create an API key.
# Resolve profile/account ids via:
#   python helper/zernio.py call profiles_list
#   python helper/zernio.py call accounts_list
# ZERNIO_API_KEY=sk_...
# ZERNIO_PROFILE_ID=
# ZERNIO_ACCOUNT_ID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: AI IMAGE GENERATION (backgrounds / kit covers)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The engine defaults are listed in connections.md (Recraft / FLUX / Midjourney).
# If you generate backgrounds with nano-banana (Gemini CLI), set GEMINI_API_KEY:
# (get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — install via
#  gemini extensions install https://github.com/gemini-cli-extensions/nanobanana)
# Canonical background prompts (no text, 3:4 clean canvas): vault/Conceptos/design_lines/
# GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY   # keep private

# NOTE: Video transcription keys (ElevenLabs Scribe / OpenAI) live in
# Content Manager/video-studio/.env — that is where the studio scripts read them.
